{
  "version": 1,
  "note": "Golden references: each entry is rendered by UPSTREAM NTSCRT's crt-smoke (golden workflow, macOS) into ref/<id>.png + ref/<id>.json, and by ntscrt_core in test_golden. Inputs live in upstream/NTSCRT/TestAssets. Output size = input size. Editing this file re-runs the golden workflow; commit the artifact's files under tests/golden/ref/. Only setups where crt-smoke renders what the app renders are comparable: the chain input's height must divide the output height (else the app supersamples, ScanlineGrid, and crt-smoke doesn't), and ntsc must be a full preset (\"default\" = pure ntsc-rs defaults in crt-smoke but the app's house defaults in ntscrt_core). crt-smoke --frame N = ntscrt frame_index N - 1. See docs/TESTING.md.",
